 "note": "The expert arm adds the 8 expert questions to the 50 GPT-4o-mini questions, drops the last 8 LLM questions that pass the floor (so the count before redundancy removal is unchanged), and uses Hamming 0.01, because at 0.15 the rarely-YES expert questions count as near-duplicates of the strongest LLM questions. It therefore differs from Rule Forest in both the questions and the redundancy threshold, and its pool is about twice as large."
